<p><strong>My dog just ate wrapping paper: quick steps</strong></p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Collect what is left</strong> and figure out roughly how much is missing, whether it was plain or foil-coated, and whether ribbon, string, a bow or tape was eaten too.</li>
